        <div class="pv-step"><div class="sn">05</div><h4>Build &amp; secure</h4><p>Install 10,000+ linear feet of 6' commercial chain link topped with a 1' three-strand barbed-wire extension, and post the property.</p><div class="bar"></div></div>
